{
    "id":  11056,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Digital SPI LED Controller for RGB + RGBW + RGBIC LED Strips - 2.4GHz - 5-24V",
    "reference":  "92110-SPIR3",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our \u003cstrong\u003e5-24V Digital SPI Controller\u003c/strong\u003e, designed \u003cstrong\u003efor digital LED strips\u003c/strong\u003e, RGB, RGBW or Monochromatic. It allows individual control of each LED in your strip, adjusting speed, brightness, direction, and dynamic modes, with the ability to save up to 4 custom scenes. Enjoy smart animations when turning lights on or off and customize colors and pixel points for detailed effects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis controller is ideal for creative and professional lighting projects, supporting 20 editable dynamic modes and providing a stable, fast signal.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eDigital SPI LED Controller for RGB + RGBW + RGBIC LED Strips - 2.4GHz - 5-24V\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the latest innovation in LED lighting control with our 3-in-1 SPI LED Controller 2.4GHz! Advanced solution offering unmatched lighting experience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features:\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSPI Signal Transmission:\u003c/strong\u003e Precise efficient control, stable high-quality connection.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2.4G Wireless Remote Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Within 30 meter radius, no cables needed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWide Compatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Supports wide range of ICs for digital LED strips (single color, RGB, RGBW).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Adjust speed, brightness, direction, multiple dynamic modes. Save up to 4 custom scenes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Animations:\u003c/strong\u003e Smooth fade in/out animations.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor Customization:\u003c/strong\u003e Different color classifications.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePixel Point Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Precise pixel management for detailed effects.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIdeal for residential, commercial, entertainment projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#2445a2;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis controller is ONLY compatible with 5m LED strip (1 roll).\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
